  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ytdlp.NET v3.2 ✨ Minor update.\n\n\t\t\t🛠 Improvements in this update\n\t\t\t- Add Metadata extensions include Metadata.Flatten() for easier access to nested metadata properties.\n\t\t\t- Fix progress parsing for better accuracy and reliability.\n\t\t\t- Add GetDeepMetadataAsync() for accessing all metadata details in a single call.\n\t\t\t- Add GetDeepMetadataRawAsync() for raw JSON metadata access.\n\n\t\t\t🛠 Notes\n\t\t\t- Companion packages recommended: ManuHub.Ytdlp, ManuHub.FFmpeg, ManuHub.FFprobe, ManuHub.Deno.\n\t\t\t- All examples and documentation updated for v3.2.\n\t\t\t- This release greatly improves reliability, cancellation, and maintainability.\n\n\t\t\tSee the repository for the full migration guide.",
